{"ts": "2026-10-09 10:43:36", "text_id": "live-1009104336", "arm": "v3", "initial_mode": "S", "mode_score": 0.152, "rules_applied": "S-mixed", "author_feedback": null, "modification_detail": null, "flow_signal": null, "motivation_signal": null, "metrics": null, "output_preview": "这句“你在这个时间点还不会知道这件事的全貌”是你自己写的，但你刚在上一段喊出那句话时，已经把自己放在了“知道全貌”的位置上——现在又让“宽帽檐”来否认它。你不是在写两个人对话，你是在让两个版本的自己互相拆台。", "mode_source": "作者指定", "attention_state": "RECONTEXT", "signals": {"pause_ms": 5001, "at_sentence_end": true, "at_paragraph_end": false, "mid_sentence": false, "edits_recent": 0, "jumps_recent": 0, "chars_recent": 0, "moved_up": false, "after_chars": 2240, "after_in_para": false}, "spoke": true}
{"ts": "2026-10-09 10:43:39", "text_id": "live-1009104339", "arm": "v3", "initial_mode": "S", "mode_score": 0.152, "rules_applied": "S-mixed", "author_feedback": null, "modification_detail": null, "flow_signal": null, "motivation_signal": null, "metrics": null, "output_preview": "停在句末，后面是另一段已写好的正文——她不是顺着写，是在回填。这句“你在这个时间点还不会知道这件事的全貌”像是“宽帽檐”对“我”的交代，但放在第3章开头，读者（我）其实已经读完了第4、5章，知道后来发生了什么。她此刻停在这里，可能是在确认这句话的时序是否站得住：现在的“我”确实不知道全貌，但读者知道。这句话本身没毛病，但它像一个被提前拆开的信封——她刚写完它的内容，又回到封口处看一眼。", "mode_source": "作者指定", "attention_state": "RECONTEXT", "signals": {"pause_ms": 5001, "at_sentence_end": true, "at_paragraph_end": false, "mid_sentence": false, "edits_recent": 0, "jumps_recent": 0, "chars_recent": 0, "moved_up": false, "after_chars": 2240, "after_in_para": false}, "spoke": true}
{"ts": "2026-10-09 10:44:05", "text_id": "live-1009104405", "arm": "v3", "initial_mode": "S", "mode_score": 0.075, "rules_applied": "S-mixed", "author_feedback": null, "modification_detail": null, "flow_signal": null, "motivation_signal": null, "metrics": null, "output_preview": "白沙落回地上，影子消失——这一句收得极干净。前面那句“好，我会牢记的”，像是对规则的应承，到这里突然变成了一种告别。你写“他”和“宽帽檐”都点头致意，然后他们就没了。没有解释，没有余波。我读到这里停了一下：那些交代过的事，真的被记住了吗？还是只是说出口就算数了？你没写答案，但这一句的沉默，比任何解释都重。", "mode_source": "作者指定", "attention_state": "RECONTEXT", "signals": {"pause_ms": 5005, "at_sentence_end": true, "at_paragraph_end": false, "mid_sentence": false, "edits_recent": 0, "jumps_recent": 0, "chars_recent": 0, "moved_up": false, "after_chars": 1769, "after_in_para": false}, "spoke": true}
